cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenGoalRL in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "OpenGoalRL: Scenario-based reinforcement learning toolkit for Google Research Football"
abstract: >-
  OpenGoalRL decomposes football into structured, repeatable scenarios paired
  with composable reward shaping, a curriculum learning pipeline, tactical
  metrics, failure diagnostics, and a reproducible benchmark harness for Google
  Research Football.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "OpenGoalRL Contributors"
version: "0.2.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Arahan-kujur/OpenGoalRL"
url: "https://github.com/Arahan-kujur/OpenGoalRL"
keywords:
  - reinforcement-learning
  - football
  - google-research-football
  - curriculum-learning
  - reward-shaping
  - gymnasium
  - stable-baselines3
